{"games":[{"id":125700405216363,"name":"🦎Camo Or Snipe! 💥","desc":"LIMITED TIME CODE (x3 SPINS AND 500 CASH): BUGSFIXED\n\nCamo or Snipe is a game similar to hide & seek, but with a twist. Hiders camouflage themselves in their surroundings, while seekers use sniper rifles to track them down and eliminate them!\n\n🦎 Hiders: Blend into the environment to avoid being spotted by the snipers. If a hider is found, they will be eliminated.\n\n🔫 Snipers: Search for hiders who are camouflaged in the surroundings. Look for subtle hints of movement or any mistakes made by the hiders.\n\nTags: Sniper, FPS, Hide and Seek, Camo, Props","path":"/game/125700405216363-camo-or-snipe","slug":"125700405216363-camo-or-snipe","thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/7194be15e0865cd36d51de388f3e35cbb63d7886ec453f36a4b59888d5e88950.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-44a3ca41d1db85f165e572c48ad25689/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":43,"visitor":31918883,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-05-05T09:20:53.092Z","creator":{"name":"Camouflage INC","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":91124927291898,"name":"Eastern Warfare [FOREST MAP]","desc":"🚨 NEW MAP AND CARS 🚨\n\nREALISTIC COMBAT\nEastern Warfare is a realistic and intense military combat experience. In this game you can engage in immersive, tactical combat ranging from trench to urban warfare.\n\nGet kills and capture objectives to earn XP and Credits to buy new weapons and gear with.\n\nPLAY WITH FRIENDS\nInvite your friends and fight together! Experience one of the most realistic and immersive war games on the platform.\n\nCREDITS\nGear created by Emil\nBuildings from Sonder & Caesar\n\n📢 DISCLAIMER\nThis game is set in a fictional future and a fictional conflict.\nIt does not represent real-world events.\nThe experience fully complies with Roblox’s Terms of Service.\n\nTags\nEastern, War, Battle, Realistic, Eastern Warfare, Warfare, Military, MilSim, FPS, Shooter, Realism, Guns, Combat, Battle, FPV, Drones, Modern War, Eastern Europe","path":"/game/91124927291898-eastern-warfare","slug":"91124927291898-eastern-warfare","thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/30dd17d7b0178a0c2abc2b17e3bca479d6e99173766beb843cee49b6c4600f5a.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-ac33733d890544608ed1f35cc85f18b6/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":43,"visitor":12439825,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-04-07T08:36:35.541Z","creator":{"name":"VisionX Interactive","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":3,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":1,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":18395923986,"name":"Mega Escape: Pony Factory","desc":"This game contains parkour, story cutscenes, fights with enemies and bosses.\nAre you ready to break out of Pony Factory?! Well let's do this!\nOvercome All the challenges of the factory.\n\nAlso check out our new game - Mega Escape: Dental Clinic.\n\nYou can also watch a story based on this game on Youtube channel Cooldad. Watching it might improve your experience with the game.\n\nThis game features:\n- Engaging parkour\n- Various interactions with the environment\n- Numerous enemies\n- Several types of weapons\n- Epic boss fights\n- Awesome cutscenes\n- Many different buffs and abilities\n- Collectible tapes that unlock watching a story in game","path":"/game/18395923986-mega-escape-pony-factory","slug":"18395923986-mega-escape-pony-factory","thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/4b6510cafb5850ccd753e2d4283c3b55ecdcd9874e2978ec0a6eda3cf8a174ee.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-c7ba47b1cdd2ead91fd553b654279347/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":43,"visitor":30669979,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-09-22T12:06:25.897Z","creator":{"name":"COOL DAD GAMES","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":127473964651554,"name":"Color Block Bridge!","desc":"🎨 Run to the color displayed on-screen!\n❌ If you are standing on the wrong color when the time is u